      "activity_description": "Provision a new Git repository, migrate the K8s SPI module out of the bundled admin project, set up build, license headers, README, CONTRIBUTING guide, and wire it to the shared CI pipeline.",
      "most_likely_effort": 16
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A3",
      "activity_name": "Create dedicated Mesos SPI repository (U4)",
      "activity_description": "Provision a new Git repository, migrate the Mesos SPI module out of the bundled admin project, set up build, license headers, README, CONTRIBUTING guide, and wire it to the shared CI pipeline.",
      "most_likely_effort": 16
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A4",
      "activity_name": "Prepare and submit pull request for existing Mesos SPI work (U1)",
      "activity_description": "Polish the existing Mesos SPI branch (commit history, code style, tests), write a clear PR description, push to the remote, address one round of review feedback, and merge once approved.",
      "most_likely_effort": 6
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A5",
      "activity_name": "Implement 'undeployed' status for CF SPI deployer (U5)",
      "activity_description": "Extend the CF deployer status logic so it returns 'undeployed' in the appropriate case instead of 'unknown'; add/update unit and integration tests covering the new status.",
      "most_likely_effort": 6
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A6",
      "activity_name": "Implement 'undeployed' status for Lattice SPI deployer (U6)",
      "activity_description": "Extend the Lattice deployer status logic so it returns 'undeployed' in the appropriate case instead of 'unknown'; add/update unit and integration tests covering the new status.",
      "most_likely_effort": 6
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A7",
      "activity_name": "Implement 'undeployed' status for K8s SPI deployer (U8)",
      "activity_description": "Extend the K8s deployer status logic so it returns 'undeployed' in the appropriate case instead of 'unknown'; add/update unit and integration tests covering the new status.",
      "most_likely_effort": 6
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A8",
      "activity_name": "Add consistent 'undeployed' status across all deployers including no-deployment-context streams (U7)",
      "activity_description": "Refactor the common status-derivation layer so every SPI consistently reports 'undeployed' (instead of 'unknown'), and add explicit handling for streams that have no deployment context at all. Includes design of the shared status abstraction, implementation, and tests.",
      "most_likely_effort": 16
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A9",
      "activity_name": "Cross-SPI integration and end-to-end testing",
      "activity_description": "Run end-to-end stream lifecycle tests on at least one SPI per supported platform (CF, K8s, Mesos, Lattice) to verify the new 'undeployed' status is reported consistently in the shell, UI, and REST API, and that streams without a deployment context are handled correctly.",
      "most_likely_effort": 8
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A10",
      "activity_name": "Documentation updates across all SPIs",
      "activity_description": "Update each SPI's README and the SCDF reference documentation to describe the new 'undeployed' status, the no-deployment-context behavior, and the new dedicated repositories.",
      "most_likely_effort": 4
    }
  ],
